Subject: [PATCH 2/4] amazon-meta-data: DOL disclosure route (LCA and PERM) for
 Amazon and Meta pay, with tests

scripts/alt-data/dol-disclosure.js finds the latest OFLC disclosure files, streams them,
keeps only Amazon and Meta employer rows and the job, place and wage columns (never the
contact, attorney or preparer columns), maps titles to the site's role families and levels,
and writes a small summary. employers.js is the entity allow-list with a near-miss report;
sample.js is a made-up sample in the FY2026 record layout. Two small fixtures come from the
real FY2026 Q3 LCA workbook (its central directory and its first two rows of indices).

